        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 15px)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 15px)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            ".counter-container": {
              "color": "#767676",
              "ul": {
                "margin-bottom": "0",
                "li": {
                  "margin-bottom": "1rem",
                  "& when (@stylizedCounters)": {
                    "list-style": "none",
                    "position": "relative",
                    "&:before": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "left": "-56px",
                      "margin-top": "-10px",
                      "padding-top": "3px",
                      "content": "''",
                      "display": "inline-block",
                      "text-align": "center",
                      "margin": "5px 10px",
                      "line-height": "20px",
                      "transition": "all .2s",
                      "color": "contrast(@counterColor)",
                      "background": "@counterColor",
                      "width": "25px",
                      "height": "25px",
                      "border-radius": "50%",
                      "& when (@countersType = 'circle')": {
                        "background": "none",
                        "border": "1px solid @counterColor",
                        "color": "@counterColor"
                      },
                      "& when (@countersType = 'square')": {
                        "border-radius": "0"
                      },
                      "& when (@mark)": {
                        "content": "'✓'"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            ".mbr-text": {
              "color": "#3d1e00"
            }
          },
          "_name": "content12",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise4",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"mbr-section article content12\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n    <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Oben\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Unten\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Stylisierte Nummern\" name=\"stylizedCounters\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Nummernfarbe\" name=\"counterColor\" value=\"#fffaf5\" condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Stylisierte Nummern\" name=\"stylizedCounters\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Zeichen\" name=\"mark\" condition=\"stylizedCounters\" checked>\n        <select title=\"Nummerntyp\" name=\"countersType\" condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n            <option value=\"default\" selected>Kreisfüllung</option>\n            <option value=\"circle\">Kreis</option>\n            <option value=\"square\">Quadrat</option>\n        </select>   \n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Hintergrundfarbe\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters> \n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n            <div class=\"mbr-text counter-container col-12 col-md-8 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>Dein Pferd schon länger ein Problem zeigt, das du durch Training nicht in den Griff bekommst</li><li>Oder Dein Pferd älter ist und du es im Rahmen seiner Möglichkeiten fit halten möchtest</li>\n                    <li>Du mehr verstehen und selbst umsetzen können willst nach der Therapie</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "content12-hy",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "viFXymd4cr",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
